  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Hou clan’s Immortal Gu House Flying Sand Pavilion, among Gu Immortals not only from Hou clan, rides a rank eight Gu Immortal, Shang Wu Jie. As Shang clan’s first supreme elder he has maintained Shang clan’s neutrality and kept good relations with all clans. Inviting him into Flying Sand Pavilion is face Hou clan would not give lightly to Yao, Luo, or Tie. When Fang Yuan’s group leaves his perception he suspects the ancient battle formation Omni-directional Travel, maps likely landing areas across Southern Border, and remarks that Wu Yong’s plan is not bad.",
      "chapters": [
        1386
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hou_clan",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_flying_sand_pavilion",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_shang_clan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_omni_directional_travel",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is named among Southern Border’s powerful rank eight Gu Immortals, beside Chi Qu You and others, when righteous path forces mass against Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1622
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-pursuit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chi_qu_you"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He offers heavy reward for whoever kills Fang Yuan. An immemorial year chicken blocks his group; he snorts, activates a rank eight killer move, and knocks the beast unconscious in one strike, shocking accompanying rank seven Gu Immortals who had not ranked his battle strength so high. Fang Yuan reads that Shang Wu Jie’s battle strength is not outstanding among Southern Border rank eights, yet Weak Chicken Gu, still with Shang clan and brought by Shang Wu Jie, creates the sensation. An immemorial year snake then obstructs him as Fang Yuan prioritizes blocking rank eight groups.",
      "chapters": [
        1623
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "one-strike-knockout",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_weak_chicken_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Wu Yong leading and Chi Qu You beside him, Shang Wu Jie presses attacks on Fang Yuan among Southern Border experts.",
      "chapters": [
        1624
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tribulation-field",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan shows rank eight methods, Shang Wu Jie first suspects possession of Xia Cha’s body plus familiar face, then hesitates when Xia Zhao notes Spring and Summer need rank eight immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        1625
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-reading",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xia_cha"
      ]
    }
  ],
